Font files notice:

- `packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic/AnthropicSansWebText.ttf` and
  `packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic/AnthropicSerifWebText.ttf` are
  proprietary typefaces of Anthropic, extracted from Anthropic's web products.
  They are included in this repository for personal use only and are **not**
  covered by the MIT license above; all rights remain with Anthropic. The npm
  package does not ship these files.
Provider icon notice: the files under `packages/assets/src/icons/providers/` (and their
`lib/icons/providers/` build copy) are vendored from farion1231/cc-switch
(MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Jason Young). They are redistributed under
the MIT License; brand names and logos remain trademarks of their respective
owners.

- `packages/assets/src/fonts/JetBrainsMonoVariable.ttf` and
  `packages/assets/src/fonts/JetBrainsMonoItalicVariable.ttf` are JetBrains Mono,
  distributed under the SIL Open Font License
  (`packages/assets/src/fonts/OFL.txt`; the package carries them under
  `lib/fonts/`). They may be redistributed with this plugin.

Crab artwork notice: the pixel crab (Clawd) is a character of Anthropic, and
all rights in it remain with Anthropic. `packages/assets/src/mascot/crab-laptop-body.png`
and `packages/assets/src/mascot/crab-laptop-ink.png` are frames of Claude Code's own
animation; the sheets under `packages/assets/src/mascot/crab/` are drawn by this project
after that character (by `scripts/draw-crab.py`, which carries the drawings).
These files, and their copies inlined into `lib/client.js`, are **not** covered
by the MIT license above. This plugin is an unofficial fan work, not affiliated
with or endorsed by Anthropic.


